Package: IncuAnalyze
Title: Reproducible Import and Preparation of Incucyte Time-Course Exports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Karsten", "Krey", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A small, metadata-driven R workflow for importing tab-delimited
    Incucyte exports, retaining raw observations, adding auditable focus and
    manual quality-control flags, generating separate interpolated tables, and
    plotting individual time-course series.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/k2rey/IncuAnalyze
BugReports: https://github.com/k2rey/IncuAnalyze/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    dplyr (>= 1.1.0),
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    ggrepel (>= 0.9.0),
    purrr (>= 1.0.0),
    readr (>= 2.1.0),
    rlang (>= 1.0.0),
    stringr (>= 1.5.0),
    tibble (>= 3.2.0),
    tidyr (>= 1.3.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
